# SHA-256 of the certificate in the pinned CI debug keystore (~/.android/debug.keystore), as
# `keytool -list -v` prints it (colon-separated hex). .github/workflows/android.yml fails the
# build when the keystore in use has another certificate. Leave the next line empty until the
# pin is known; the workflow then warns, prints the value to put here, and still fails a run that
# generated a new key. Do not pin 77:17:DD:...:9B:C2 from run 41435774504: that pull_request run
# missed the cache and its generated key was never saved, so no later build can match it.

